% of sales), so the asset base is being harvested rather than grown.","Its Rule of 40 score is 13, below the 40 that marks a healthy growth business."],"own":["Insiders own 6.6%, meaningful skin in the game, and institutions hold 98%.","Insiders have only sold over the past year (6 sales, net $17.9M sold).","Shareholder yield is a modest 1.4% (0.3% in buybacks and 1.1% in dividends).","The share count has shrunk 0.6% a year over five years, steadily raising each holder's stake."],"people":["With about 5,200 employees, each generates about $491K of revenue, 0.8x the Basic Materials median, and revenue has grown 10.6% a year across its filed history.","That works out to $44K of free cash flow per employee.","CEO pay is $2.8M (6x revenue per employee), and compensation governance scores poorly (10/10, lower is better).","Stock compensation averages $11K per employee."]},"profile":{"v":"AVOID","conv":32,"head":"Avoid: priced 75% above its fair value of $16.84.","pros":["12 analysts' mean target $47.33 (+60%)","12-1 month momentum +57%"],"cons":["Trades 75% above fair value of $16.84","ROIC 6.4% vs WACC 10.2%","P/E 34.7x vs sector 14.2x","EV/EBITDA 16.4x vs sector 7.7x","P/FCF 31.5x vs sector 20.4x"],"flags":["Priced 75% above its fair value of $16.84"],"need":[],"buy_below":14.31,"vc":{"base":16.84,"base_src":"dcf","bear":10.48,"bull":26.32,"alt_median":5.57,"n_alt":3,"gap":2.023,"dispersion":0.2681,"level":"LOW","why":["DCF is 202% above the other models' median ($5.57)"]},"med":{"pe":14.1531,"ev_ebitda":7.701,"pfcf":20.3799,"pb":1.7565,"roic":0.0589,"gross_margin":0.2564,"fcf_margin":0.052,"div_yield":0.0205}},"mc_quantiles":[6.71,8.98,10.48,11.56,12.41,13.22,14.01,14.75,15.43,16.15,16.98,17.72,18.48,19.38,20.45,21.42,22.66,24.41,26.32,29.76,36.33],"mc_drivers":{"growth":0.8,"discount_rate":0.165,"terminal_growth":0.006,"exit_multiple":0.029},"ticker":"ESI","date":"2026-11-20"}